{"resourceIdentifier":"3283","resourceName":"ASYA LALE BIOGAS PROJECT","description":"Asya Lale Biogas project is a biogas to-energy project that will generate renewable energy by capturing biogas from animal manure -via anaerobic digestion- and utilizing it to produce thermal and electric energy through biogas systems. The project is being implemented in Karatay, İsmil district, KONYA province, in Turkey. The project began to generate electricity on October 22nd, 2020. According to Electricity Generation License, the biogas generator system has the maximum operational capacity of 6 MWe. The annual feed-in electricity is estimated to be 45,030,000 kWh. While heat generated at the plant is used at the facility to warm the digesters, the electricity generated is directly fed to the national grid. This project adopts the renewable crediting period of 7 years, twice renewable for 21 years. The expected average annual emission reductions are 411,705 tCO2eq/y.","location":{"latitude":37.782699,"longitude":33.098849},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-08-15","endExclusive":"2022-09-15","endInclusive":"2022-09-14"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3283"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Ismil/Karatay/Konak"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"83551"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livestock, enteric fermentation, and manure management"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AM0073"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Carbon Check (India) Private Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE